   "date": "2026-07-22",
   "title": "【岸和田市・貝塚市】7月26日は両市で人気イベント「久米田池夏まつり」と「yosakoiソーリャ！祭り」が開催予定です！",
   "html": "<p>イベントの情報が数々入ってきています。2026年7月26日は岸和田市池尻町にある世界かんがい施設遺産の久米田池で夏まつりが開催されます。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-59850\" src=\"https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848-Copy.jpeg\" alt=\"久米田池夏祭り\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848-Copy.jpeg 1280w, https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848-Copy-768x614.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></p>\n<p>場所は久米田池西堤遊歩道駐車場、フードコーナーは13:00～、式典イベントは16:00～となっています。花火の打ち上げは20:00～20分間となっています</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-59849\" src=\"https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848.jpeg\" alt=\"久米田池夏祭り\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848.jpeg 1280w, https://kishiwada-kaizuka.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/96/2026/07/IMG_9848-768x614.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></p>\n<p>ステージのスケジュールなどは<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/people/%E4%B9%85%E7%B1%B3%E7%94%B0%E6%B1%A0%E5%A4%8F%E3%81%BE%E3%81%A4%E3%82%8A%E5%AE%9F%E8%A1%8C%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E4%BC%9A/100067149697747/?locale=ja_JP\">フェイスブックアカウント</a>で当日、発表されるようです。同じ7月26日、貝塚市では「<a href=\"https://cosmostheater.or.jp/event/\">第27回yosakoiソーリャ！祭り</a>」がコスモスシアター大ホールで開催されます！開演時間は14:00～です。同時に「yosakoiソーリャ！マーケット」も開催されるそうです。</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DaenHTthwPC/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DaenHTthwPC/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"https://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><g transform=\"translate(-511.000000, -20.000000)\" fill=\"#000000\"><g><path d=\"M556.869,30.41 C554.814,30.41 553.148,32.076 553.148,34.131 C553.148,36.186 554.814,37.852 556.869,37.852 C558.924,37.852 560.59,36.186 560.59,34.131 C560.59,32.076 558.924,30.41 556.869,30.41 M541,60.657 C535.114,60.657 530.342,55.887 530.342,50 C530.342,44.114 535.114,39.342 541,39.342 C546.887,39.342 551.658,44.114 551.658,50 C551.658,55.887 546.887,60.657 541,60.657 M541,33.886 C532.1,33.886 524.886,41.1 524.886,50 C524.886,58.899 532.1,66.113 541,66.113 C549.9,66.113 557.115,58.899 557.115,50 C557.115,41.1 549.9,33.886 541,33.886 M565.378,62.101 C565.244,65.022 564.756,66.606 564.346,67.663 C563.803,69.06 563.154,70.057 562.106,71.106 C561.058,72.155 560.06,72.803 558.662,73.347 C557.607,73.7